          "short": "$5$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}5^2\\div\\sqrt{9+16}&=5^2\\div\\sqrt{25}\\\\&=25\\div\\sqrt{25}\\\\&=25\\div5\\\\&=5\\end{align*}$$",
